      "text": "No deviation is established under POL-RD-01. The governing figure is gps_trace.trace_distance_km, 21.2 km, against the booked optimal of 18.4 km — an excess of 2.8 km, or 15.2% of optimal. POL-RD-01 requires the excess to exceed BOTH 20% of optimal and 0.8 km; the percentage gate fails, so no deviation exists and the rider's claim falls at the threshold. Disclosed: EV-GPS-00110 is IMPAIRED (GPS_GAP, LOW_COVERAGE) at weight 0.39; the impairment sits inside the tunnel gap and does not alter the driver-favourable total that POL-RD-07(i) mandates.",
